  "body": "RARE OREWA OPPORTUNITY – BUY ONE OR SECURE BOTH!\r\n\r\nOpportunities like this are hard to find! Secure one or both of these adjoining sections in the sought-after Orewa location and explore the possibilities.\r\n\r\nMaraeariki Avenue, Orewa – 669m² section\r\n\r\n22 Maraeariki Avenue, Orewa – 741m² section\r\n\r\nWhether you’re looking to secure a section for your future home, land bank for the future, this is an opportunity worth exploring.\r\n\r\nEnjoy the Best of Orewa Living\r\n\r\nConveniently located just minutes from Orewa’s vibrant town centre, beautiful beaches and local schools, these sections offer the perfect balance of coastal lifestyle and everyday convenience.\r\n\r\n• Two adjoining sections\r\n• Buy one or buy both – the choice is yours\r\n• Generous land sizes\r\n• Prime Orewa lifestyle location\r\n• Motivated overseas vendor – keen to sell!\r\n\r\nDon’t miss this rare opportunity to secure one or both sections and make your plans a reality. Contact us today for more information or to arrange a viewing.",
